  "_doc": [
    "The interiors' dressing (src/client/interiors.ts), draw-only, on top of the city's rooms (city.interiors in sf.city.json:",
    "door, inward, floor, height, polygon, anchors). Never collides: the city's own collision is untouched. Per room kind:",
    "floor (an overlay on the room's floor: wood, checker, terrazzo, marble; colours, metres per tile), ceiling (an overlay",
    "under the city's ceiling: colour, beams), and lists of placed things. A placement: at (an anchor of the room; its own",
    "heading is the frame) or frame room (the door and the way in), off [right, ahead] metres in that frame, z metres over",
    "the floor (onTop: on whatever is below instead, a counter or a table), face degrees turned from the frame's heading,",
    "wall: pushed back (against the way it faces) onto the wall behind it, this far off it (the wall found at wallZ metres",
    "over the floor, else its own height).",
    "rugs (w, h, colours), lights (pendant, tube, spot, chandelier, sconce: a fixture with a glowing lamp and a pool of",
    "light on the floor; colour), signs (neon, board, chalk, led: text lines on a plane, w, h, colours), props (kind and",
    "colours: the props interiors.ts builds), people (a data/pedestrians.json type and an act, src/client/vignettes.ts ACTS,",
    "seat for a chair; they join the crowd as small vignettes standing on the room's floor, and keep off the cast's own anchors",
    "(cast.json inside: Hector at the grill, Gloria at her window, Big Lou behind his counter). drawDistance: metres from the",
    "camera a room's dressing is drawn within; pool: the light pools' strength by day and by night; lampGain: the street",
    "lights' share of the dressing's light at night (the room's own fixtures and pools carry the night look); indoorLampReach:",
    "the reach (m) of the city's own night lamps inside a room (at a street light's 13 m two of them blow out a small room);",
    "indoorBloom: the night bloom's share while the camera is inside a room (the export's lamp lenses haze a small room)."
  ],
